", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q1 FY2024", "period_end": "2024-03-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.0125, "filing_name": "Amazon.com Inc 10-Q Q1 FY2024", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000083/amzn-20240331.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-03-31__mdna__0010", "ticker": "AMZN", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q1 FY2024", "period_end": "2024-03-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.0122, "filing_name": "Amazon.com Inc 10-Q Q1 FY2024", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000083/amzn-20240331.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-03-31__mdna__0012", "ticker": "AMZN", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q1 FY2024", "period_end": "2024-03-31", "section": "mdna", "score": 0.012, "filing_name": "Amazon.com Inc 10-Q Q1 FY2024", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000083/amzn-20240331.htm", "truncated": false}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-03-31__unknown__0007", "ticker": "AMZN", "form": "10-Q", "fiscal_label": "Q1 FY2024", "period_end": "2024-03-31", "section": "unknown", "score": 0.0078, "filing_name": "Amazon.com Inc 10-Q Q1 FY2024", "sec_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872424000083/amzn-20240331.htm", "truncated": false}], "collapsed_near_duplicates": 246, "dropped_candidates": 351, "token_estimate": 31959, "gaps": [], "degraded": []}, "answer": {"direct_answer": "Amazon's risk factor language is largely stable across the filings provided, with incremental additions rather than wholesale changes. Between the fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024) and the fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025), the operating-results risk adds tariff policy changes to the list of disruptions and to the inventory risk language [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0012][AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021]. The fiscal 2025 filing's list of factors also adds mention of land, water, and energy-related items already present, but newly adds climate-change cost and demand impacts to the fluctuation factors [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0012]. The regulation risk now names satellite communications services and healthcare among regulated areas, which the Q3 fiscal 2024 (ended September 30, 2024) text did not [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0024][AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0023]. The Q2 fiscal 2025 and Q1 fiscal 2025 10-Q chunks provided do not contain risk factor text, so quarter-by-quarter changes cannot be fully traced.", "company_findings": [{"ticker": "AMZN", "company": "Amazon.com Inc", "findings": [{"point": "Tariffs are newly named: the fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025) lists tariff policy changes among disruptive events and cites pricing changes from tariff policy in its inventory risk, while the fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024) inventory risk lists pricing changes without tariffs.", "citations": ["AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0012", "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021", "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "The regulation risk's scope widened: the Q3 fiscal 2024 10-Q (ended September 30, 2024) listed mobile communications, while the Q3 fiscal 2025 10-Q (ended September 30, 2025) and fiscal 2025 10-K list satellite communications services and healthcare.", "citations": ["AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0023", "AMZN_10Q_2025-09-30__risk_factors__0023"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "AI and satellite themes grew within the operating-results factors: the fiscal 2025 10-K adds satellite communications services and AI-related reputation language, building on the Q3 fiscal 2024 10-Q wording that covered web services and AI-related social or ethical issues.", "citations": ["AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0011", "AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0010"], "unverified": false}, {"point": "Core themes persisted unchanged: the growth-rate fluctuation risk, with the same statements about fixed expenses and softening demand, appears in the fiscal 2024 and fiscal 2025 10-Ks.", "citations": ["AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0010", "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0010"], "unverified": false}]}], "comparison_table": {"columns": ["Risk area", "Fiscal 2024 10-K (ended December 31, 2024)", "Fiscal 2025 10-K (ended December 31, 2025)"], "rows": [["Inventory risk pricing", "Lists pricing changes, no tariff mention [AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020]", "Adds pricing changes from tariff policy [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021]"], ["Disruption events", "Trade disputes; no tariff language in shown text [AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0011]", "Adds tariff policy changes and retaliatory actions [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0012]"], ["Regulated areas", "Q3 fiscal 2024 lists mobile communications [AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0023]", "Lists satellite communications services and healthcare [AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0024]"]]}, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0012", "claim": "Tariff policy changes in disruptions list", "quote": "tariff policy changes (such as tariffs proposed or implemented by the U.S. and other countries and any retaliatory actions)"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0021", "claim": "Inventory pricing risk cites tariffs", "quote": "pricing (including as a result of tariff policy changes)"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2024-12-31__risk_factors__0020", "claim": "Prior-year inventory risk without tariffs", "quote": "rapid changes in product cycles and pricing, defective merchandise"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10K_2025-12-31__risk_factors__0024", "claim": "Regulation scope includes satellite and healthcare", "quote": "artificial intelligence technologies and services, satellite communications services, healthcare"}, {"chunk_id": "AMZN_10Q_2024-09-30__risk_factors__0023", "claim": "Earlier regulation scope", "quote": "artificial intelligence technologies and services